WEBVTT

00:03:28.746 --> 00:03:31.874
at the Tate Modern in London,

00:03:31.874 --> 00:03:35.711
I decided to make this world
I'm describing a reality.

00:03:36.921 --> 00:03:40.383
The museum space is incredibly vast,

00:03:40.383 --> 00:03:44.095
and I knew right away
that I wanted to transform it

00:03:44.095 --> 00:03:46.389
into an aquarium of machines.

00:03:47.181 --> 00:03:49.141
I asked myself,

00:03:49.183 --> 00:03:53.229
"What would it feel like to live
in the world with machines

00:03:53.229 --> 00:03:56.565
that could live in the wild
and evolve on their own?"

00:03:57.275 --> 00:03:59.277
To explore this question,

00:03:59.318 --> 00:04:03.948
I created two new machine species
that I call "aerobes."